    "body": "Quick pass on head `834abc50a1dede6c973c0b466a15c206220c5bf2`. This pass reads the PR and does not build.\n\n- The PR is stacked on #2027 and merges cleanly with its base branch.\n- The author's gate is green on this head: the three tests of `crates/ui/tests/theme_example.rs`, `--test theme_files` (14), `--lib theme` (23), and clippy on `camcraft-ui`.\n- The body has the `Changelog:` line and the closing line. The UI look does not change, thus the PR has no screenshots.\n- Item 5 of #2025 (the list of the fixed numbers that are not theme settings) is not in this PR. A follow-up issue holds it.\n- Before #2027 merges, the merging session retargets this PR to `main`.\n\nThe PR is ready for the independent review.\n",
